00:42:29.246 --> 00:42:30.147
JOHN FRANZIA STUDIED ENOLOGY,

00:42:30.214 --> 00:42:32.216
THE SCIENCE OF WINEMAKING AT THE

00:42:32.283 --> 00:42:33.250
UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA, DAVIS,

00:42:33.317 --> 00:42:35.653
AND BEFORE THAT HE SPENT HIS

00:42:35.719 --> 00:42:36.754
CHILDHOOD LEARNING EVERY ASPECT

00:42:36.820 --> 00:42:39.590
OF THE WINEMAKING BUSINESS FROM

00:42:39.657 --> 00:42:42.259
HIS PARENTS AND HIS GRANDPARENTS

00:42:42.326 --> 00:42:42.860
. HE LEARNED ABOUT VITICULTURE

00:42:42.927 --> 00:42:45.829
BUSINESS AT HIS FAMILY'S

00:42:45.896 --> 00:42:46.463
VINEYARDS PLANTED THROUGHOUT THE

00:42:46.530 --> 00:42:49.533
CENTRAL VALLEY, SEEN FIRSTHAND

00:42:49.600 --> 00:42:52.236
THE RESULT OF HARD WORK AND THE

00:42:52.303 --> 00:42:56.073
CALIFORNIA DREAM. ACTUALIZING

00:42:56.140 --> 00:42:57.141
THE FRANZIA FAMILY HAD BEEN IN

00:42:57.207 --> 00:42:59.209
THE WINE MAKING BUSINESS SINCE

00:42:59.276 --> 00:43:00.377
THE 1800S, AND THE BRONCO WINE

00:43:00.444 --> 00:43:02.680
IS STILL THE LARGEST PRIVATELY

00:43:02.746 --> 00:43:03.580
HELD VINEYARD THROUGHOUT THE

00:43:03.647 --> 00:43:06.483
COUNTRY. THE PLANT IS OPERATING

00:43:06.550 --> 00:43:09.420
SOUTH OF CERES IN STANISLAUS

00:43:09.486 --> 00:43:11.822
COUNTY, AND IT OPENED IN 1973.

00:43:11.889 --> 00:43:15.592
THIS COMPANY EMPLOYS ABOUT 750

00:43:15.659 --> 00:43:18.696
PEOPLE YEAR ROUND AND OVER 250

00:43:18.762 --> 00:43:19.697
MORE DURING THE HARVEST AND

00:43:19.763 --> 00:43:23.000
CRUSH. IT HAS BUILT ITS OWN

00:43:23.067 --> 00:43:23.968
BOTTLING PLANT IN NAPA AND

00:43:24.034 --> 00:43:25.936
ACQUIRED WINEMAKING OPERATIONS

00:43:26.003 --> 00:43:26.737
NEAR ESCALON AND MADERA IN THE

00:43:26.804 --> 00:43:29.406
CENTRAL VALLEY. JOHN FRANZIA WAS

00:43:29.473 --> 00:43:31.075
A FARMER AT HEART, AND HE

00:43:31.141 --> 00:43:32.676
BELIEVED THAT THE GREATEST WINES

00:43:32.743 --> 00:43:36.046
BEGAN WITH EXCEPTIONAL FAMILY

00:43:36.113 --> 00:43:38.949
CENTERED VINEYARDS. HIS LEGACY

00:43:39.016 --> 00:43:39.984
FOCUSED ON HIGH QUALITY WINES AT

00:43:40.050 --> 00:43:42.319
AFFORDABLE RATE FOR BUYERS SUCH

00:43:42.386 --> 00:43:44.054
AS THE QUIRKY TWO BUCK CHUCK,

00:43:44.121 --> 00:43:45.689
WHICH WAS CREATED AND

00:43:45.756 --> 00:43:46.690
POPULARIZED BY HIS COUSIN AND

00:43:46.757 --> 00:43:51.562
BRONCO KHÓ FOUNDER FRED FRANZIA.

00:43:51.628 --> 00:43:52.596
THE BRONCO FOUNDERS AND THE

00:43:52.663 --> 00:43:54.865
FRANZIA FAMILY HAVE DEEP ROOTS

00:43:54.932 --> 00:43:56.000
IN THE LOCAL AGRICULTURE AND

00:43:56.066 --> 00:43:58.535
MANUFACTURING INDUSTRY OF

00:43:58.602 --> 00:43:59.403
CALIFORNIA. NOT ONLY IS

00:43:59.470 --> 00:44:00.704
WINEMAKERS, BUT PRODUCERS AND

00:44:00.771 --> 00:44:04.608
GLASS ARTISANS. JOHN IS SURVIVED

00:44:04.675 --> 00:44:06.977
BY HIS WIFE, MARILYN, OF 62

00:44:07.044 --> 00:44:09.947
YEARS, FOUR CHILDREN, NINE

00:44:10.014 --> 00:44:13.117
GRANDCHILDREN AND TWO SISTERS. I

00:44:13.183 --> 00:44:14.385
